package card

const resourcesHTML = `{{define "budget"}}
<section id="budget" aria-label="Proposed operating budgets">
<div class="findings budget-band">
<article><span class="eyebrow">KAS / per replica</span><h2>{{n .Card.resourceProfile.kas.cpuMilli 0}}m + {{n (div .Card.resourceProfile.kas.memoryMiB 1024) 0}} GiB</h2><p>{{n .Card.resourceProfile.kas.replicas 0}} kube-apiserver replicas. CPU request + memory request, not measured usage.</p></article>
<article><span class="eyebrow">Etcd / per replica</span><h2>{{n .Card.resourceProfile.etcd.cpuMilli 0}}m + {{n .Card.resourceProfile.etcd.memoryMiB 0}} MiB</h2><p>{{n .Card.resourceProfile.etcd.replicas 0}} main containers; metrics proxies are separate containers.</p></article>
<article><span class="eyebrow">Whole HCP / excluding instrumentation</span><h2>{{if .Resources}}{{n .ResourceRequests.cpuCores 2}} CPU<br>{{n (div .ResourceRequests.memoryMiB 1024) 3}} GiB{{else}}{{n (div .Card.topology.requestAccounting.excludingExperimentalKSM.cpuMilli 1000) 2}} CPU<br>{{n .Card.topology.requestAccounting.excludingExperimentalKSM.memoryGiB 3}} GiB{{end}}</h2><p>Sum of active regular + restartable-init requests; experimental KSM excluded.</p></article>
</div>
<p class="muted">Including experimental instrumentation: {{if .Resources}}{{n .InstrumentedRequests.cpuCores 2}} CPU / {{n (div .InstrumentedRequests.memoryMiB 1024) 3}} GiB, recomputed from all {{len .Resources.series}} containers.{{else}}{{n (div .Card.topology.requestAccounting.includingExperimentalKSM.cpuMilli 1000) 2}} CPU / {{n .Card.topology.requestAccounting.includingExperimentalKSM.memoryGiB 3}} GiB (card inventory).{{end}} Not scheduler-effective Pod requests or billing allocation.</p>
<p>CPU can borrow above its request; the proposed policy has no CPU limit. Memory requests and Go soft targets are not OOM boundaries. The policy's {{n .Card.resourceProfile.memorySafetyMultiplier 0}}x hard-memory safety limit is separate; downstream exceptions retain their actual limits.</p>
<p class="muted">Catalogs: {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.deployedRegistries 0}} registries, each {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.cpuMilli 0}}m / {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.memoryMiB 0}} MiB. Catalog startup/readiness/liveness timeout {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.startupReadinessLivenessTimeoutSeconds 0}}s, connect {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.connectTimeoutSeconds 0}}s, RPC {{n .Card.resourceProfile.catalog.rpcTimeoutSeconds 0}}s. <a href="#resources">Full policy and exceptions</a>.</p>
</section>{{end}}
{{define "resource-usage"}}
<section id="component-usage"><div class="section-heading"><span class="index">Resources / recorded runtime</span><h2>Component resources over time</h2></div>
{{if .Resources}}
<p>Saved observations: {{utc .Resources.window.start}} to {{utc .Resources.window.end}} UTC. Native evaluation cadence {{n .Resources.window.expectedStepSeconds 0}}s; no downsampling or live queries. Shading uses the card's exact APF arm boundaries, not the first resource sample.</p>
<p class="annotation">Orange marks observations above a request, not failures. Purple marks <strong>Go-managed memory</strong> above GOMEMLIMIT; cgroup usage, working set and RSS cannot establish a Go-target violation. GOMEMLIMIT governs Go-managed memory, not total container memory.</p>
<p class="muted resource-scroll-hint">Swipe each resource plot horizontally to read the full timeline. Keyboard: focus the plot and use the arrow keys.</p>
<div id="resource-primary"></div>
<h3>Explore another component</h3><div id="resource-picker"></div><div id="resource-selected"></div>
<p class="muted">Solid: selected cgroup metric. Faint dashed: Go-managed memory, when available. Dashed reference: request (black when shared, replica color when different). Dotted purple: GOMEMLIMIT. Orange segments interpolate crossings only between adjacent observed slots for visual guidance, not proof of an exact crossing time. Nulls and missing cadence break every trace and highlight; dots retain isolated observations.</p>
<p class="muted">Coverage is valid / expected evaluation slots per metric, not independent scrapes or fresh observations. CPU is a trailing rate; early arm samples can include pre-arm activity. Maxima are sampled peaks over the displayed period and need not be simultaneous. Unavailable Go curves and absent targets remain unknown, including non-Go exceptions. No whole-HCP Go target is summed.</p>
<details><summary>Complete container inventory ({{len .Resources.series}} containers), budgets and raw observations</summary>
<div class="table-scroll"><table id="resource-inventory"><caption>Every supplied container, including instrumentation. MiB for all memory fields; null means unknown, never zero.</caption><thead><tr><th>Workload / Pod / container</th><th>CPU request (cores)</th><th>Memory request</th><th>CPU limit</th><th>Hard memory</th><th>GOMEMLIMIT</th><th>Scope</th><th>Raw points</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{range .Resources.series}}<tr><th>{{.workload}}<br><code>{{.pod}} / {{.container}}</code></th><td>{{n .requests.cpuCores 3}}</td><td>{{n .requests.memoryMiB 3}}</td><td>{{n .limits.cpuCores 3}}</td><td>{{n .limits.memoryMiB 3}}</td><td>{{n .goMemoryLimitMiB 3}}</td><td>{{if .instrumentation}}Instrumentation{{else}}HCP{{end}}{{if .initContainer}} / restartable init{{end}}; controlled: {{text .controlled}}</td><td><details class="resource-raw" data-series-id="{{.id}}"><summary>{{len .points}} points</summary><pre></pre></details></td></tr>{{end}}
</tbody></table></div><p>Opening a points row displays all its observations without a preview cap. The full resource payload is also embedded once in this offline document.</p></details>
<ul>{{range .Resources.limitations}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{end}}</ul>
<details><summary>Resource extraction method, bindings and coverage evidence</summary><pre>{{pretty .Resources.method}}</pre></details>
<details><summary>Resource source metadata (labels only; no files opened or hashes verified here)</summary><pre>{{pretty .Resources.sources}}</pre></details>
{{else}}<p class="empty">No resource time series supplied. Use the optional --resources sidecar to compare observed usage with per-container budgets.</p>{{end}}</section>
<style>
#budget{padding-top:8px}.budget-band h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.7rem);letter-spacing:-.025em}.resource-panel{padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);min-width:0}.resource-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px 18px;margin:12px 0}.resource-controls label{font-size:.85rem;display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;min-height:36px}.resource-controls input[type=checkbox],.resource-controls input[type=radio]{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--teal)}.resource-controls select,.resource-controls input[type=search]{min-width:0;max-width:100%;padding:8px;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);font:inherit}.resource-controls button{padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid var(--teal);background:var(--white);color:var(--teal);border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer}.resource-controls button:focus-visible,.resource-controls input:focus-visible,.resource-controls select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange);outline-offset:2px}.resource-replicas{border:0;padding:0}.resource-replicas legend{font-size:.85rem}.resource-replicas label{border-bottom:2px solid var(--replica)}.resource-chart{min-width:0}.resource-chart svg{width:100%;min-width:0;display:block}.resource-chart svg text{font:11px system-ui;fill:var(--muted)}.resource-chart figcaption{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.resource-summary{font-size:.8rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.resource-panel .chart-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}#resource-picker select{max-width:100%;width:28rem}#resource-inventory th{overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-width:28rem}.resource-raw pre{max-height:26rem;overflow:auto;white-space:pre;max-width:32rem}#component-usage>details>pre{max-height:32rem;overflow:auto}#component-usage{min-width:0}@media(max-width:760px){.resource-panel .chart-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}.resource-controls>label{max-width:100%}.resource-controls select{width:100%}.resource-controls{gap:8px}.resource-raw pre{max-width:16rem}}
.resource-plot{min-width:0;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}.resource-plot:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange);outline-offset:2px}.resource-plot svg{min-width:650px}.resource-scroll-hint{display:none}
@media(max-width:760px){.resource-scroll-hint{display:block}.hero{padding:24px 0 16px}.hero h1{font-size:2.4rem;margin:16px 0}.hero .lead{font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.4}.budget-band{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.budget-band article:last-child{grid-column:1 / -1}.budget-band h2{font-size:1.65rem;margin-bottom:8px}.budget-band .eyebrow{font-size:.65rem;margin-bottom:8px}.budget-band p{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:8px}}
</style>{{end}}`
